{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213630","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213630","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521363001:0":{"text":"... Oh. It's you two.","source_cn":"……是你们啊。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494526644DE759E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521363002:0":{"text":"Are you doing okay?","source_cn":"你还好吗？<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42E10294DE0A9A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521363003:0":{"text":"No... Not at all.","source_cn":"不……一点也不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF9F8443D396500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521363004:0":{"text":"I think I finally understand how the Hunting Goddess felt... what it's like to lose someone you love.","source_cn":"我……我好像能理解狩猎神的感受了……失去爱人时的感受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59404682015323FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521363005:0":{"text":"It hurts... deeply. Like there's a hole where your heart used to be.","source_cn":"那真的很难受……很痛。就好像胸口被掏空了一块。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3DD81902E4DF1CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521363006:0":{"text":"I don't blame Marco. He did what he thought was right. We were born on opposite sides, and met in the middle of a war...","source_cn":"我不怪马尔科，他的选择没有错。只是……只是我们生来分属...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F37A15BB94B7B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1521363006":{"text":"I don't blame Marco. He did what he thought was right. We were born on opposite sides, and met in the middle of a war...","source_cn":"我不怪马尔科，他的选择没有错。只是……只是我们生来分属不同的种族，又碰上了战争……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F37A15BB94B7B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521363007:0":{"text":"Yeah... that's what everyone says. Maybe one day I'll be okay. Maybe I'll forget Marco...","source_cn":"嗯……他们都说是那样。等过一段时间，我就会好起来，忘记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4D81F996836191B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521363008:0":{"text":"I hope that day comes soon. But deep down... I don't think it ever will.","source_cn":"我希望那天能早点到来……但我又不觉得自己真的能忘了他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10F239C9DBBA027A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521363009:0":{"text":"Thanks for checking on me. Don't worry, I'm not going to do anything foolish. I just need a little time to work through it...","source_cn":"谢谢你们记挂着我，我不会做傻事的。我只是需要一点空间去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7764E6F1E285514B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"You'll heal in time.","source_cn":"会慢慢好起来的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5A2A7541E42D2F36","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You'll heal in time.","female":"You'll heal in time.","variant_male_record_index":"78135","variant_female_record_index":"78136","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Time will wash the pain away.","source_cn":"时间会洗刷痛苦","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF3CBA297D9424DB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Time will wash the pain away.","female":"Time will wash the pain away.","variant_male_record_index":"78137","variant_female_record_index":"78138","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芙":{"text":"Fufu","source":"芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}